{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About This Game</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark Memories is an episodic psychological horror game based on road thriller, slasher, and survival thriller genres. You are currently viewing the second episode of the Dark Memories anthology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Dark Memories: Investigation</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first episode of Dark Memories, you play as Agent Carter, sent to investigate a murder case in a small town. However, you quickly realize this is no ordinary place, and you can't trust anyone. You must both survive and solve this complex case while uncovering the town's dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environment and realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VHS film aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driving mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue and messaging system with NPCs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental interaction</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2787000?t=1765666778","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2787000?t=1765666778","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765666778","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2787000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765666778","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game features objects stained with blood and includes dialogue that contains strong language and profanity, which are integral to th